THIRD-PARTY INSPIRATION

Exceed Chess draws conceptual inspiration from Prosfair, a board game concept
by Overpowered Games (Kickstarter). Exceed Chess is an independent, original
work and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or derived from Prosfair or
Overpowered Games. No assets, code, or copyrighted material from Prosfair
are used in this project.

The rules of chess are in the public domain.
